# TestJavaToCSharpLangchain4j.alternatives: langchain4j's core sources printed as C# with the other options of the
# library mappings, slf4j as Serilog and Jackson as Json.NET (Newtonsoft.Json), judged by Roslyn with those packages
# referenced (see JavaToCSharpRatchet). It keeps the options compiling; langchain4j.ratchet holds the defaults.
#
# 2026-10-11, first record: the same numbers as the default options: 271 files compile; 232 errors (not ratcheted).
#
# 2026-10-12, the type arguments Java infers and C# cannot (a method type parameter no parameter mentions, Value_
# getStore(int)) printed explicitly: 271 -> 273 compiling files.
#
# 2026-10-12, companions of self-bounded types (CSharpCompanions) for their wildcards and raw uses: 273 -> 284
# compiling files.
#
# 2026-10-13, the JDK mappings that came with JAXB (java.net.URL, Class.getResource, Duration.parse/toString, Locale's
# language tags): 154 -> 153 unmapped uses.
#
